#: src/modules/shared/presentation/ui/AgentRunInstructions.tsx:82
#~ msgid "Paste it in a terminal: the worker starts in the foreground, its logs show up right there, and Ctrl-C stops it. host.docker.internal is simply this machine seen from inside Docker (on Linux, use localhost with --network host)."
